\ Exercises every public stdlib word (static proof corpus + runtime self-check).

\ ---- user-defined words: covers user :M / : and the runtime return-BST ----
:M SP 20 lit putc ;            \ 0x20 space
:M NL 0A lit putc ;            \ 0x0A newline
: sq dup * ;                   \ a user `:` word (call + gen_bst)

( block-comment coverage for `(` `)` — nested ( like this ) too )
"== cover ==" puts NL

\ ---- literals: char, escape, space, decimal, negative, hex, string ----
'A' lit putc 'B' lit putc '\n' lit putc      \ -> AB
' ' lit putc                                  \ space char literal
2A lit u. SP                                  \ hex 0x2A -> 42
42u lit u. SP                                 \ decimal -> 42
-7 lit . NL                                   \ signed -> -7
"str\n" puts                                 \ string + escape -> str

\ ---- arithmetic: 7 op 3 ----
7u lit 3u lit + u. SP                          \ 10
